                        "review": "It's not even a walking simulator, in the first few minutes of the game you're stuck in a boat ride with no interactivity whatsoever for what feels like an eternity. All the game is like that, you go from one attraction of the park to another and you listen to the poorly acted story. I'm sorry, but this game is not worth your time.",
